       \nTRACK EVERY LAP\nCapture every split with pinpoint accuracy. Record laps with a tap, a double-tap, or a natural hand gesture — whatever feels right in the moment. Every split is logged instantly and displayed in real time, so you always know exactly where you stand. Review your full lap history at a glance, right on your wrist.\n\nHEALTHKIT WORKOUTS\nEvery session counts. Stopwatch Max integrates with Apple Health, logging each timing session as a workout. Lap events are recorded as activity milestones, giving you a structured log of every session — no extra taps or setup required.\n\nSIRI SHORTCUTS\nYour hands are busy. Start, record a lap, and reset — all hands-free with Siri. Control Stopwatch Max with your voice from anywhere, at any time. Whether you're mid-rep, mid-lap, or mid-race, your voice is all you need.\n\nWATCH COMPLICATIONS\nAdd Stopwatch Max to any watch face and launch it instantly with a single tap — no swiping, no searching. Have your stopwatch ready the moment you need it.\n\nBUILT TO LAST\nYour timer state is saved automatically in the background. Switching apps, checking a notification, or restarting your watch won't cost you a single second. Come back to your stopwatch exactly as you left it.\n\nWORKS IN YOUR LANGUAGE\nFully localized in English, German, Spanish, French, Japanese, Russian, and Chinese.\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\nNo ads. No subscriptions. No data collected. A one-time purchase that respects your time and your privacy.\n\nSimple enough for your first workout. Precise enough for your best one.", "sellerUrl": "https://stopwatch.despawn.me", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "4639744", "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Stopwatch Max: Lap Timer", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/stopwatch-max-lap-timer/id6760036684?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "ave